title: "CodexEssaySkill: evidence-constrained academic writing with adversarial skill evaluation"
message: "If you use the public rubric or aggregate measurements, please cite this repository."
type: software
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-07-31
repository-code: "https://github.com/Shawn200212/CodexEssaySkill"
url: "https://github.com/Shawn200212/CodexEssaySkill"
authors:
  - name: "Shawn200212"
abstract: >-
  A public demonstration and evaluation record for a private Codex academic-writing skill covering
  ACM CHI and venue-general conference manuscripts. The evaluation emphasizes research architecture,
  claim-evidence traceability, epistemic calibration, paradigm and construct fidelity, units and
  comparisons, preservation of nulls and harms, human-AI labor, author voice, provenance, and current
  venue compliance.
keywords:
  - academic writing
  - ACM CHI
  - HCI
  - adversarial evaluation
  - agent skills
